 "words": 219,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "If God is for us, tell me who can be against us",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 13.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He didn't spare his Son, gave him up for all of us",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 17.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Who brings a charge, who condemns, who's the judge",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 21.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Christ died and rose, now he's interceding with love",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 23.9,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Trouble or hardship, persecution or hunger",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 50.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Nakedness, danger, the sword pulling under",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 54.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In all these things we are more than conquerors",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 57.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Through him who loved us, yeah, that's the anchor",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 59.88,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing can separate us from the love of God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 62.25,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not death, not life, not angels, not powers",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 55.07,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not height, not depth, nothing in all creation",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 50.03,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing can separate us from his love",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 45.34,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm convinced in my bones and I'm sure in my soul",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 35.67,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not things in the present or the future unknown",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 32.86,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not the night that I cried or the day that I fell",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 30.32,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not the voice in my head saying I couldn't be held",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 27.57,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm a child of the King, I'm called by his name",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 25.45,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His love doesn't flicker, his love doesn't change",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 22.61,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So I walk in the storm and I stand in the fire",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 19.93,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Held by a love that is in the night",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 17.15,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing can separate us from the love of God",
   "heard": 9,
